# Not deployed to Vercel.
#
# admin.html is protected only by a passphrase in its own source, which
# is not security. Excluding it is stronger than a 404 rule — the file
# simply is not on the server. Run it locally.
#
# netlify/ is the other host's function wrapper. Harmless, but there is
# no reason to ship it here.
